r Awakening.<br /> <br /> Or when you wake up at the same time as someone else, to the same Watchtower. The current guess is that they get backdoors into each other's souls.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> &quot;the Watchtowers can totally awaken multiple people at the same time. It's just that the mage population is so low it almost never happens (but is becomjng measurably more common as the global human population booms). The results are... Odd.&quot;<br /> &quot;And to do with the consequences of more than one life being &quot;loaded&quot; into the Watchtower's Lustrum.&quot;<br /> &quot;The mages end up bound together, like a Familar bond to one another, and randomly swap details of their lives retroactively. You might exchange parents, home towns... bodies.&quot;<br /> &quot;As the Supernal Realm treats them, metaphysically, as one person.&quot;<br /> &quot;They're more like Cloak and Dagger. You keep individual minds and souls and Gnosis, but share a Mana pool and can cast through one another's senses.&quot;<br /> <br /> Words of Dave.<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/15464-raphatheascended","name":"RaphaTheAscended","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar15464_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-10T04:22:23-07:00","id":1311193,"title":"","content":"I see, very cool, that can lead to some absolutely fascinating storytelling opportunities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>New experiences are the font of creativity, when seeking inspiration, break your routine.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1278855-the-agathos-kai-sophos-